{"text": "Tur Counc For Tonacco Resrarcu-U.S.A., Ive.\n900 THIRD AVENUE\nNEW YORK, N.\u00a5. 10022\n\nMoALMASTER, PH.D. October 9, 1991\n\nMary Jean Sawey, Ph.D.\nUniversity of Pennsylvania\nDept. Radiation Oncology\n528 Clinical Research Bldg.\n422 Curie Blvd.\nPhiladelphia, PA 19104-6142\nRe Case #3535\n\nDear Dr. Sawey:\nYour recent inquiry concerning support by this Council of a proposed\nresearch study has now been considered by the members of the Scientific Advisory\nBoard.\n\nThey asked me to notify you that they cannot encourage formal\napplication for support of this study at the present time,\n\nWe trust that you will obtain the support you seek elsewhere,\nSincerely you\n\nHarmon C, McAllister\n\nHCM/s",
